        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mw itabaruka ryabo, Dawidi agarutse avuye kwica wa Mufilisitiya, abagore bava mu bisagara vyose vy’Abisirayeli, bavyina batamba, baza gusanganira umwami Sauli, bafise udushāko tw’ingoma n’utundi tuvuga nk’ inanga, bavuza impundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
