            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Sauli abarira Dawidi, ati Nguyo umukobga wanje mukuru Merabu, nzomuguha; ariko rero, uz’ ube umuhizi wo kundwanira, urwane intambara z’Uhoraho. Kuko Sauli yavuga, ati Yoye kuzongwako, arikw az’ agwe ku Bafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
