            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye abaganwa b’Abafilisitiya baza gutera; kand’ uko bātera kwose, Dawidi yagira ibakwe kurusha abandi bantu bose ba Sauli, bituma izina ryiwe riba rurangiranwa.",
